acceptance_criteria:
1) Deploy hotpatch to affected Dedicated GPU pools and Private control planes with automated canary gating;
2) Affected tenant slices routed to verified fallback model variant without >5% additional latency;
3) KV cache reconciliation performed and validated using synthetic prefixes;
4) Customer comms template approved and triage channel created;
5) Post-mortem with root cause and three remediation actions published within 5 business days.
